<title>USA: Royal Dutch/Shell Group Q3 net.</title>
<headline>Royal Dutch/Shell Group Q3 net.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Royal Dutch Shr	  $2.46		    $1.97</p>
<p> Shell Shr		  $1.36		    $1.09</p>
<p> Net		    2,066,000		1,658,000</p>
<p> Revs		  42,637,000	     37,210,000</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Royal Dutch Shr	  $7.78		    $6.80</p>
<p> Shell Shr		   4.29		    $3.75</p>
<p> Net		    6,537,000		5,720,000</p>
<p> Revs		 124,246,000	    111,754,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: U.S. dollar translation for the underlying sterling and guilders provided by the group.</p>
<p>Royal Dutch per share per Royal Dutch Petroleum Co share. Shell per share per Shell Transport and Trading Co Plc New York share which is equal to six 25p shares. Portion of net income for per share results is 63.77 percent Royal Dutch and 36.23 percent Shell Transport.</p>
<p>Translation to CCS (similar to LIFO) accounting from FIFO used would reduce 1996 Q3 results $0.24/shr for Royal Dutch and $0.13/shr for Shell and increase 1995 $0.12/shr and $0.07/shr, respectively.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
